# Exclude everything, then explicitly allow only what the Dockerfiles need.

# ── Deny all ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**

# ── Allow IBM MQ JARs (glob covers all JARs in the lib directory) ────────────
!jar/wmq/JavaSE/lib/*.jar

# ── Allow compiled application classes ───────────────────────────────────────
!Illumina_JMS/bin/**
